      "text": "y = ii\ny = mx + b\nm = (corner1.y - corner0.y)\n  / (corner1.x - corner0.x)\nb = corner0.y\n\nii = mx + b\n0 = mx + b - ii\nmx = ii - b\nx = (ii - b) / m\n\nintercept.x = corner0.x + x",
