      "originalText": "nnw + nne = 0\nnnw + sne = 1\nsnw + sne = 2\nsnw + nne = 3\n\n0 + 0 = 0\nabs(0 + -1) = 1\n3 + -1 = 2\n3 + 0 = 3",
